Package: echo-weather
Version: 1.0.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi (>= 3.42.0), python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, libgtk-4-1
Recommends: gir1.2-adw-1
Maintainer: Demid <dezaetterg@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/demid/echo-weather
Description: Atmospheric meteorological desktop application
 Echo Weather is an atmospheric meteorological desktop application for Linux
 with real-time particle rendering, multi-model forecast consensus, and
 detailed meteorological analytics.
